{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:08 2026-05-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:08 2026-05-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:08 2026-05-27 HKT</p><p>社交平台傳出消息，深圳一高速路段發生巴士撞運油車事件，有指現場為深圳南坪快速西麗段隔音屏附近路段。從高空角度拍攝所見，隔音屏大範圍起火，來回車路已封閉。</p><img alt=\"事發位置隔音屏發生大火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0eed8f5c97c1172a634091b3d4e72153/2026-05/FDownloader_Net_AQOR9tUd_E8mzLVGgINjC0bi_fiTjjIirOZhD3rF7PIBrpIF1M9y9KD4qyTxL8_JqN9hOtCh0hHRKk-R7Oyoyp7cf_N6yDiN3i-lTuxXgQUpNA_720p__HD_mp4_snapshot_01_06__2026_05_27_18_24_44_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"事發位置隔音屏發生大火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ebb769c6c89f017aceae191cde9b8aba/2026-05/FDownloader_Net_AQOR9tUd_E8mzLVGgINjC0bi_fiTjjIirOZhD3rF7PIBrpIF1M9y9KD4qyTxL8_JqN9hOtCh0hHRKk-R7Oyoyp7cf_N6yDiN3i-lTuxXgQUpNA_720p__HD_mp4_snapshot_01_01__2026_05_27_18_24_37_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"從遠處看到，隔音屏火勢不斷漫延。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e76064badbe93779cf8791fc91b4ebdb/2026-05/FDownloader_Net_AQOR9tUd_E8mzLVGgINjC0bi_fiTjjIirOZhD3rF7PIBrpIF1M9y9KD4qyTxL8_JqN9hOtCh0hHRKk-R7Oyoyp7cf_N6yDiN3i-lTuxXgQUpNA_720p__HD_mp4_snapshot_00_51__2026_05_27_18_24_28_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"事發位置傳出爆炸聲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be4b5d158fce3617fd5b3302e2eb30c4/2026-05/FDownloader_Net_AQOR9tUd_E8mzLVGgINjC0bi_fiTjjIirOZhD3rF7PIBrpIF1M9y9KD4qyTxL8_JqN9hOtCh0hHRKk-R7Oyoyp7cf_N6yDiN3i-lTuxXgQUpNA_720p__HD_mp4_snapshot_00_31__2026_05_27_18_24_15_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"事發位置傳出爆炸聲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e6c0cd2d91ae4f7cdf0494419ac7cfb/2026-05/FDownloader_Net_AQOR9tUd_E8mzLVGgINjC0bi_fiTjjIirOZhD3rF7PIBrpIF1M9y9KD4qyTxL8_JqN9hOtCh0hHRKk-R7Oyoyp7cf_N6yDiN3i-lTuxXgQUpNA_720p__HD_mp4_snapshot_00_16__2026_05_27_18_24_08_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"事發位置傳出爆炸聲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/654fea648ad10c27d4c9219288379832/2026-05/FDownloader_Net_AQOR9tUd_E8mzLVGgINjC0bi_fiTjjIirOZhD3rF7PIBrpIF1M9y9KD4qyTxL8_JqN9hOtCh0hHRKk-R7Oyoyp7cf_N6yDiN3i-lTuxXgQUpNA_720p__HD_mp4_snapshot_00_00__2026_05_27_18_24_04_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"事發位置傳出爆炸聲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a83587f1e4765c227d421e6a540eb7d1/2026-05/FDownloader_Net_AQOjiF1X9_Hn7RO4mtjlyB6KSiHKus0XpHsN0iSD0HN23pMWslMLY1g7Ya5FB3Tsy2gJJ55JfLAm3okmKxq08_3lud_urrAkCeGqTH4mnUsCsA_720p__HD_mp4_snapshot_00_01__2026_05_27_18_00_46_.jpg\"/><p>網上流出影所見，事發後現場出現大火，大量黑煙直衝半空。期間更發出巨響，四周民眾均要退後。另在路段未封前，車輛經過時看到隔音屏有大量火舌掉下。目前官方未有通報事件及傷亡數字。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T10:39:29.413734+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}